From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 22:49:38 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 04/19] kcm: Offer the flipped transforms apart from the turn

The four turns stay as they are. A new Flip horizontally check box beside them
mirrors the picture before the turn, which gives the four flipped transforms of
wl_output that libkscreen and KWin already carry. The model keeps the turn and the
mirroring in two roles, so the turn buttons keep their meaning and a turn keeps the
mirroring. A mirrored screen carries a small icon in the arrangement view, and the
size of a screen turned a quarter is swapped for the flipped quarter turns too.

Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5
